```text
The active branch has tests for the ``ncclTimeout`` result and timeout-producing
LSA/GIN barrier paths. The MPI companion test uses device-barrier scenarios and
host-visible asynchronous state. These tests do not establish a generic elapsed
time deadline for every stock Socket collective and do not validate a USB4 link.
